  message: "Re-scoped 2026-10-25 (owner-approved fold): point 3 (members of a class declared with a qualified name, class X::Impl, stay unqualified) is the same mechanism as INV-tohuj (_get_enclosing_class, cpp.py:1448, reads only a direct type_identifier) and is now owned there, with the self-bind and pimpl-forward consequences. This item keeps points 1-2 (in-class constructor; member template)."  # 25b8
